ld #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rename the pre-scan hook config surface and add `--no-hooks`[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: rename `highlights.pre_scan_command` to `highlights.pre_scan_hook` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](config key, env override, report labels, docs), reject the legacy names[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]loudly, add the `-n|--no-hooks` flag to `bob highlights`, and export a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hook-marker env var to the hook child process.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Auto-scan from bob_xlib_pull and follow the rename in chezmoi[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]dotfiles[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]dotfiles: update the managed bob config and `maybe_bob_highlights_sync` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for the new names, make `bob_xlib_pull` run `bob highlights --no-hooks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scan -w` after its pull on macOS with hook and cron-lock guards, extend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the bashunit regression tests, and refresh the Highlights bridge [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-23","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-23.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-58b8188983a8f26fa7dfb39fa92e0098","started_at":"2026-09-20T19:38:51.727647+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-23","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-23.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-23.2","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-23.land"]}
